Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Integration Fails to Start
Symptoms: Integration shows Error status

Solution:

# Check integration logs
kamel logs <integration-name>

# Check pod events
kubectl describe pod -l camel.apache.org/integration=<integration-name>

# Verify operator status
kubectl get pods -n camel-k
Issue 2: Service Not Accessible
Symptoms: Cannot reach REST endpoints

Solution:

# Check service status
kubectl get services

# Verify port forwarding
kubectl port-forward service/<service-name> <local-port>:<service-port>

# Check firewall rules
curl -v http://localhost:<port>/api/health
Issue 3: Resource Constraints
Symptoms: Pods stuck in Pending status

Solution:

# Check node resources
kubectl describe nodes

# Check resource requests
kubectl describe pod <pod-name>

# Scale down if necessary
kubectl scale deployment <deployment-name> --replicas=1
